    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2307630/extras/c6790ac8584d756bbc25f2848c546b62.avif?t=1725003298\" /></span><br>Burnt out on the dullness of your play sessions, you voyage into the mountains to seek out a legendary Game Master. However, you quickly regret your decision after his game becomes a tad too real and involves you in an unexpected way...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In <strong>Fremdganger - The Cheating Demon</strong>, you can:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Make meaningful decisions to influence the fate of the protagonists</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Solve reality-breaking puzzles through the <strong>RETURN</strong> mechanic</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore two layers of existence: The Storyteller's hut in a 3D first-person perspective, and the tabletop world in a top-down 2D perspective</li></ul><br><i><strong>Immerse yourself and forget your surroundings.</strong></i>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2307630/extras/c6790ac8584d756bbc25f2848c546b62.avif?t=1725003298\" /></span><br>Burnt out on the dullness of your play sessions, you voyage into the mountains to seek out a legendary Game Master. However, you quickly regret your decision after his game becomes a tad too real and involves you in an unexpected way...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In <strong>Fremdganger - The Cheating Demon</strong>, you can:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Make meaningful decisions to influence the fate of the protagonists</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Solve reality-breaking puzzles through the <strong>RETURN</strong> mechanic</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore two layers of existence: The Storyteller's hut in a 3D first-person perspective, and the tabletop world in a top-down 2D perspective</li></ul><br><i><strong>Immerse yourself and forget your surroundings.</strong></i>",
    "short_description": "In this twisted meta-game, you follow four friends on their cursed journey of love and betrayal, told through a long-forgotten Storyteller. Solve puzzles, make meaningful decisions, and unravel the mystery behind the Storyteller with the help of a reality-breaking RETURN-mechanic.",
